OL,3,ACommittee calls for bill to address AI
OL,4,Athreat to human rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-party group of MPs and peers
OL,7,Fhas identified human rights risks posed
OL,8,Fby artificial intelligence (AI) which
OL,9,Fexisting laws, they argue, are
OL,10,Fill-equipped to cover.
OL,12,FThe Joint Committee on Human Rights
OL,13,F(JCHR) published a report calling for a
OL,14,Fnew bill on AI to "address the scale
OL,15,Fand seriousness" of such threats.
OL,17,F"Nowhere in the world, including the
OL,18,FUK, has a current legislative and
OL,19,Fregulatory approach to AI that is fit
OL,20,Ffor purpose," said Alex Sobel MP, the
OL,21,Fcommittee's chair.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
