OL,3,AQuestions mount over what an AI
OL,4,A'slowdown' would look like
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday head of AI company
OL,7,FAnthropic, Dario Amodei, urged the pace
OL,8,Fof development to be slowed down - the
OL,9,Fbosses of two rival AI firms, Sam
OL,10,FAltman of OpenAI and Elon Musk said
OL,11,Fthey agreed with him.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
