OL,3,ASwedish left-wing bloc narrowly ahead
OL,4,Awith election too close to call
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweden's general election remains too
OL,7,Fclose to call with the left-wing bloc
OL,8,Fmarginally ahead as the vote count
OL,9,Fcontinues.
OL,11,FWith more than 90% of ballots processed
OL,12,Fearly on Monday, the left-wing bloc was
OL,13,Fin front by approximately 20,000 votes.
OL,15,FProjections posted by Sweden's
OL,16,Felectoral authority showed the Social
OL,17,FDemocrats' Magdalena Andersson would
OL,18,Flikely finish with a three-seat
OL,19,Fmajority over the rival four-party
OL,20,Fcoalition led by current conservative
OL,21,FPrime Minister Ulf Kristersson.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
